# Default-deny: only the runtime build inputs enter the build context.
*

!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!deluge_orphaned_files/
!deluge_orphaned_files/**

# Re-exclude anything nested inside the allowed package (bytecode, caches,
# local secrets/state, tests).
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/tests
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py
**/conftest.py
